onal function that performs three-dimensional image processing.\n\nIt is to be installed and used on general-purpose IT equipment, etc. that meets the specifications specified by Holoeyes Corporation (hereinafter referred to as \"the Company\") in the manner specified by the Company and provided as a download. For details, please refer to the attached document.\n\nThe latest version of the attached document (electronic attachment) https://holoeyes.jp/pmda/", "short_description": "The medical imaging software \"Holoeyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AkwH8tzKMxkQ7kNvwHR0oqH&_nc_oc=AdoPRfP933-x3iGnFYmScRnRbd5ztn3xlbGPtOSSJiuWOp41LjASX8_K5nCeIurAV5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQybo_-peGQ4VPbjhF-AkEedg3O_ZfT1Oz7Cu7fBnRQ3w&oe=6AEDFF8D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UckPV3oQd60Q7kNvwEzT2RX&_nc_oc=AdrokXmLB-BA_79RxPciZMBwYeAb2eflJvnwyLRxqCxCyeJl8kPbA7KPTmuO_ZPEOjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJYYBcjwEmz0zMsS09BijX5qh7mRtOtZNVO1LwV0M6eg&oe=6AEDF1EC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345